B = [
('Jeep','North America','1940s-present','cars','In the style of Jeep, rugged, utilitarian, go-anywhere adventure. Upright, boxy, squared-off forms with flat panels, short overhangs, exposed bolts and hinges and a confident, tough stance. Matte and satin finishes in olive drab, khaki, sand, rust orange, forest green and black, with bright yellow or red used as a single bold accent. Seven vertical slot motifs and round forms repeat as a recurring mark. Stencilled, blocky, condensed lettering, canvas, webbing, cast metal and rubberised textures, and scuffed, weathered honesty. Sun-baked outdoor photography with dust, mud and open terrain.'),
('Nike','North America','1970s-present','footwear','In the style of Nike, athletic motion and defiant confidence. Forms are streamlined and aerodynamic, with sweeping check-like curves, sharp tapered cuts and layered panels that suggest speed. Palette is stark black, white and grey with a single electric accent such as volt yellow, hot orange or crimson, and bold colour-blocked contrasts. Technical mesh, foam, rubber and glossy synthetic skins show engineered detail. Lettering is heavy, tightly set, italic or condensed sans-serif, often in huge scale. Graphics and photography are high-contrast, gritty and dramatic, with sweat, spotlights and cropped close action.'),
('Adidas','Europe','1970s-present','sportswear','In the style of Adidas, sporty heritage built on strict repetition. Three parallel stripes of equal width run as the signature graphic, with trefoil and triangular marks and clean geometric panelling. Palette is crisp white, black, navy and royal blue with red or green accents, often in strong colour blocks with thin contrast piping. Materials are smooth leather, suede, soft tracksuit knit and mesh with tidy stitching. Lettering is lowercase, rounded or bold and geometric. Retro terrace and street energy mixed with sharp modern graphic grids, flat studio lighting and confident, casual, youthful attitude.'),
('Coca-Cola','North America','1900s-present','beverages','In the style of Coca-Cola, joyful, refreshing, nostalgic Americana. Dominant saturated red paired with clean white, used in broad flat fields with a flowing white ribbon wave. Lettering is a looping, handwritten-looking script with generous swashes, balanced by simple bold sans-serif support text. Shapes are curvy, contoured and hourglass-like, with glossy glass, polished chrome and condensation droplets. Illustration and photography are warm, sunny and optimistic, showing smiling people, sparkle, ice and bubbles. Round discs and badge shapes, vintage enamel sign charm, and a timeless feel-good, shareable cheer.'),
('Apple','North America','2000s-present','electronics','In the style of Apple, pared-back, precise and quietly luxurious. Single continuous forms with perfectly rounded corners, razor-thin edges, seamless joins and no visible fasteners. Materials are brushed aluminium, polished glass and soft-touch matte finishes in silver, space grey, white, black and a few muted pastel tints, with colour mainly coming from the screen or content. Lettering is clean, light to medium sans-serif with generous spacing. Everything is reduced to the essential, with ample negative space. Photography is bright, soft-shadowed and shot on seamless white or gradient backdrops, calm, friendly and futuristic.'),
('Sony','East Asia','1980s-90s','electronics','In the style of Sony, compact, precise, high-tech engineering with a confident premium feel. Clean rectangular and softly bevelled forms with tight panel gaps, miniaturised proportions and rows of neat small controls. Finishes are matte black, titanium silver and brushed metal, with occasional bold primary or translucent colour accents, and a deep gloss on screens and lacquer. Lettering is small, crisp, slightly wide sans-serif with tiny printed labels and thin indicator lines. Futuristic but disciplined, with soft rim lighting and a dark, glossy studio look in photography.'),
('Levi Strauss','North America','1870s-present','fashion','In the style of Levi Strauss, durable American workwear heritage. Indigo denim in deep to faded blue with raised contrast stitching in orange-tan thread, rivets, bar-tack reinforcements and a small red tab accent. Surfaces show honest wear, whiskering, fading and visible twill diagonals. Graphics are vintage leather-patch and woodcut-style badges with two-horse-like pulling imagery, bold serif and slab lettering in cream, red and black. Construction is straight, sturdy and flat-felled with exposed seams. Casual, rugged, democratic, with warm, grainy, sun-bleached documentary photography.'),
('Chanel','Europe','1920s-present','fashion','In the style of Chanel, restrained Parisian elegance built on black and white. Strict monochrome of black, ivory and cream with gold, pearls and chains as the only sparkle, and a quiet touch of beige or pale pink. Forms are simple, boxy, balanced and tailored, with quilted diamond surfaces, braided trim, tweed boucle texture and interlocked double-C style marks. Lettering is thin, spaced, upright sans-serif or clean classic capitals. Nothing fussy, minimal ornament chosen with precision, luxurious soft materials and crisp craft. Photography is monochrome, high-contrast and refined, with timeless, understated chic.'),
('Burberry','Europe','1900s-present','fashion','In the style of Burberry, classic British heritage with a sharp check pattern. A tan, camel and honey base crossed by black, white and red lines forms a recognisable plaid, used as lining, trim or bold all-over cover. Materials are gabardine, trench-coat twill, wool and leather in stone, khaki, navy and black, with horn or metal buttons, buckles and belts, and tailored, belted, structured silhouettes. A mounted knight emblem and wide-spaced serif capitals mark the brand. Muted rainy-day palette, now often with a vivid modern accent. Understated, proper, weatherproof and polished.'),
('Porsche','Europe','1960s-present','cars','In the style of Porsche, athletic, low and compact, design driven by function. Smooth, rounded, sculpted forms with a sloping, curved profile, soft arching haunches, round pairs of lamps and clean, taut surfaces with minimal trim. Finishes are glossy paint, satin black, brushed aluminium, titanium and carbon weave in silver, black, graphite, white, guards red and deep blue, with occasional bright accent colours. Lettering is crisp, upright and engineered, with a crest-like badge. Interiors and objects are driver-focused, minimal and precise. Photography is moody, low-angled and sharply lit, with a disciplined, precise, understated performance feel.'),
('Ferrari','Europe','1960s-80s','cars','In the style of Ferrari, passionate, theatrical Italian speed. Long, low, wedge-sharp or voluptuous sculpted forms with sensual curves, flowing fenders, sharp creases, wide stance and dramatic intakes. Deep, glossy rosso red dominates, joined by yellow, black, ivory and silver, with a prancing horse emblem on a yellow shield and thin racing stripes. Surfaces are lacquer-bright with chrome, carbon, polished metal and tan leather. Lettering is elegant, slanted, flowing script and bold racing capitals. Photography is glamorous, high-contrast and low-angled, with motion blur, sunlight and raw emotion.'),
('Studio Ghibli','East Asia','1980s-2010s','animation','In the style of Studio Ghibli, gentle hand-painted wonder and quiet humanity. Soft watercolour and gouache backgrounds with luminous towering white cumulus clouds, deep green meadows, glowing blue skies and richly detailed foliage, in a warm natural palette of grass green, sky blue, earthy brown and sunset gold. Characters have simple rounded faces, small dot eyes and natural, expressive movement with clean thin outlines and flat soft shading. Cosy, cluttered, lived-in rustic spaces mix with fantastical creatures. Light is airy and nostalgic, calm, curious, and respectful of nature.'),
('Disney classic','North America','1930s-50s','animation','In the style of Disney classic, enchanted storybook animation. Rounded, soft, bouncy forms with squash and stretch, big expressive eyes, clean flowing ink outlines and flat cel colour with gentle shading. Painted backgrounds are lush, softly blended watercolour in storybook pastel and jewel tones, with fairy-tale castles, forests and glowing magical sparkle. Palette is bright but gentle, with royal blue, rosy pink, sunny gold and woodland green. Characters have graceful, exaggerated poses and clear silhouettes. Ornamental gothic and curly storybook lettering. Warm, wholesome, whimsical and musical.'),
('Pixar','North America','1995-present','animation','In the style of Pixar, warm, emotional, polished three-dimensional storytelling. Chunky, rounded, toy-like forms with simplified, appealing proportions, big expressive eyes and exaggerated, readable poses. Surfaces have soft subsurface glow, subtle textures and tactile detail in plastic, fabric, metal and skin. Colour is saturated and cinematic, with warm golden light balanced by cool shadows and strong colour scripting that shifts with mood. Lighting is soft, volumetric and glowing with shallow depth of field. Environments are richly detailed and lived-in. Humorous, heartfelt and family-friendly.'),
('Patagonia','North America','1980s-present','outdoor','In the style of Patagonia, honest outdoor utility with an earthy, conscientious spirit. Functional, roomy, rounded shapes with practical seams, tough stitching and unpretentious proportions. Colour blocking uses bright primaries such as red, royal blue, yellow and teal against natural fawn, forest green, rust and navy, often with vintage faded tones. Textures are brushed fleece, ripstop, canvas, wool and recycled fabric with a soft worn look. Graphics are simple jagged mountain skyline silhouettes in a rounded badge, with plain bold sans lettering. Photography is vast, real, unretouched landscapes.'),
('Barbour','Europe','1900s-present','outerwear','In the style of Barbour, British countryside heritage built for rain, mud and long use. Waxed cotton in olive, sage, navy and dark brown with a slightly shiny, creased, weathered surface that ages with character. Details include corduroy collars, heavy metal zips, storm flaps, poacher-style pockets and quilted diamond stitching, in practical, roomy, tailored shapes. Tartan and muted tweed-like linings add quiet pattern. Lettering is traditional, tidy serif in a small emblem. Photography is misty, green, damp, moody and rural, with dogs, estates and hedgerows. Timeless, sturdy and understated.'),
('Zippo','North America','1930s-present','accessories','In the style of Zippo, compact, rugged American metalwork with a vintage, collectable charm. Sturdy rectangular forms with softly rounded corners, polished chrome, brushed steel and brass finishes with a worn, handled shine. Surfaces carry crisp engraved or enamel-printed graphics such as pinups, flames, eagles, tattoo-style icons and retro geometric patterns, in saturated red, black, cream, teal and orange. Typography is bold block capitals and vintage script, with small stamped marks and neat hinges. Mid-century Americana, tough, reliable, personal and witty.'),
('Muji','East Asia','1980s-present','homeware','In the style of Muji, no-brand minimalism, quiet, modest and thoughtful. Plain, simple, softly rounded geometric forms with no logos, no ornament and no unnecessary features. Natural, raw, unbleached materials such as pale wood, kraft paper, cotton, linen, white ceramic and matte plastic in off-white, beige, oatmeal, grey, charcoal and muted navy. Finishes are matte, soft and tactile, with neat even stitching and honest construction. Lettering is small, plain, lightweight sans-serif in black or grey on neutral labels. Calm, airy, generous empty space, with soft daylight photography on uncluttered backdrops.'),
('Olivetti','Europe','1950s-70s','electronics','In the style of Olivetti, playful Italian modernism with sculptural confidence. Smooth, bold, softly rounded or crisp geometric forms in glossy moulded plastic and enamel metal, treated like art objects with sensual curves and compact proportions. Cheerful colours such as vivid red, pastel blue, mint green, lemon yellow and ivory are used in single strong tones, with black detail and small bright accents. Lettering is clean, lowercase, spaced sans-serif. Graphic design uses bold abstract dots, lines and colour fields on a grid. Witty, optimistic, human, refined and artistic.'),
('IKEA','Europe','1990s-present','furniture','In the style of IKEA, democratic Scandinavian practicality, bright and friendly. Simple, light, flat-planar shapes, modular rectangles with soft corners, visible joints and clever space-saving logic. Pale birch, pine and white laminate are paired with cheerful saturated blue and yellow plus red, green and soft pastels, in bold, playful patterns and plain colour blocks. Materials feel affordable but honest, such as light wood, painted board, woven textiles and moulded plastic. Lettering is bold, rounded, plain sans-serif in capitals. Photography is airy, sunlit, tidy yet lived-in, with plants, rugs and everyday cosy scenes.'),
]
